---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer | devsyllabus"
  description="devsyllabus disclaimer: study material provided as-is, verify exam-critical details against your course's prescribed materials."
  path="/disclaimer/"
>
  <Breadcrumbs crumbs={[{ label: 'Disclaimer' }]} />

  <h1>Disclaimer</h1>

  <h2>Educational purpose</h2>
  <p>
    All content on devsyllabus is published for educational purposes. It
    is a study aid, not an official syllabus document. Always check
    requirements against your own course's prescribed materials, past
    papers, and examiner guidance.
  </p>

  <h2>Syllabus variation</h2>
  <p>
    Courses differ in what they include and how they define terms. Where
    conventions vary, our notes flag it, but your examiner's convention
    wins in the exam room.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    Links to external sites (RFCs, documentation, textbook publishers) are
    provided for reference. We do not control and are not responsible for
    their content or availability.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    Content is fact-checked and corrected under our
    <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>, but provided as-is
    with no guarantee. Report suspected errors via the
    <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    Related: <a href="/terms-of-use/">terms of use</a>,
    <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>.
  </p>
</Layout>
